    "ServerVersionResponseDto adds required featureLevel; advertise 1 because official ServerVersion.fromDto gates passkeys at 2.",
    "ServerFeaturesDto adds required backups; return false because official FUTO backup integration is not implemented.",
    "SyncApiRepository request families, framing, ACK and capability thresholds remain unchanged for 3.4.1.",
    "iOS NetworkApiImpl and URLSessionManager are byte-identical to the previous frozen source.",
    "Foreground upload changes are logging-only; background cancellation now clears both Live Photo task groups, without changing server fields.",
    "Asset and session updates change security metadata; existing adapter routes require authenticated owners and keep unsupported writes rejected.",
    "New passkey routes, FUTO backups, JPEG XL and HIF format expansion remain outside the implemented adapter media/auth scope.",
    "Keep old OpenAPI, manifest, source inventory and 3.3.1 reference reports as historical evidence; they do not validate 3.4.1."
